    /// <summary>
    /// Why `accept` was refused.
    /// unknown_delivery: No delivery with this id was pushed to this connection's session under
    /// an unrevoked worker API key. Accept on the connection that received the `work`.
    /// delivery_timed_out: The delivery's `accept_deadline` had passed, including when it had
    /// already been marked failed to deliver.
    /// already_resolved: This same delivery was already accepted (or is in flight) or reported,
    /// or its run was cancelled. A cancelled run's delivery stays `pushed`; the accept is
    /// refused because the run is cancelled. For `one_runner`, another delivery for this run
    /// already won the run-scoped accept race. Broadcast modes do not choose a winner.
    /// </summary>
